{"id":"632763","name":"五彩鸡丝","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632763/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"110g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"80g"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"80g"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"50g"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"1g"},{"name":"寿司醋","amount":"8g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"泡好的木耳，反复搓洗。","img":"images/632763/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡胸肉买的东西的，化冻。","img":"images/632763/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冷水下锅。","img":"images/632763/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮熟鸡胸肉，把木耳捞出来。","img":"images/632763/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洗净浮沫。","img":"images/632763/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡胸也捞出来，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/632763/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"胡萝卜切丝。","img":"images/632763/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放锅里煮熟。","img":"images/632763/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捞出洗净浮沫。","img":"images/632763/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切黄瓜丝和红椒丝。","img":"images/632763/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切木耳丝。","img":"images/632763/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放上胡萝卜丝。","img":"images/632763/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"鸡胸撕成粗丝放碗里。","img":"images/632763/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放所有蔬菜，加食盐。","img":"images/632763/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放寿司醋（这个醋的味道丰富，别的单纯的醋味道不行的哦）。","img":"images/632763/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/632763/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"装盘，整理一下。","img":"images/632763/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632763/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"所有的食材都是不舍只入。比如41克至49克的食材，也都记50克。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}